e>HELD</code> status. This is the "seat lock" step.</p><h4>Headers</h4><div=
 class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i></i>=
<i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">HTTP headers</span></div><pre><code><spa=
n class=3D"t-c">// 1. Authorization =E2=80=94 signed-in user or guest sessi=
on; limits active holds per user (bots)</span>
<span class=3D"t-h">Authorization</span>: Bearer &lt;user-token&gt;

<span class=3D"t-c">// 2. Content-Type =E2=80=94 the body is JSON</span>
<span class=3D"t-h">Content-Type</span>: application/json

<span class=3D"t-c">// 3. X-Request-Id =E2=80=94 tracing</span>
<span class=3D"t-h">X-Request-Id</span>: req_77b1e0d2</code></pre></div><h4=
>Request</h4><div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dot=
s"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">JSON</span></div><pre><=
code>{
