is enough:</strong> "Partners call the same Search, Hold and Pay APIs throu=
gh a partner gateway with their own keys, quotas and rate limits."</p><ol c=
lass=3D"nl"><li><span class=3D"n">1</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>Wh=
o:</strong> travel agents through GDSs (Sabre, Amadeus, Travelport) and OTA=
s (Expedia). Airlines increasingly use IATA <strong>NDC</strong>, a modern =
XML/JSON standard, instead of old GDS messages.</p></div></li><li><span cla=
ss=3D"n">2</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>Same inventory:</strong> a =
