<h4>Components in one line each</h4><ol class=3D"nl"><li><span class=3D"n">=
1</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>API Gateway:</strong> authentication=
 (users and partners), rate limits, bot checks, routing. The <strong>waitin=
g room</strong> is switched on only during fare sales (Deep Dive 6).</p></d=
iv></li><li><span class=3D"n">2</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>Search=
 Service:</strong> answers searches from Redis only.</p></div></li><li><spa=
n class=3D"n">3</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>Booking Service:</stro=
ng> owns the PNR and runs the checkout steps in order (hold =E2=86=92 pay =
=E2=86=92 commit =E2=86=92 ticket).</p></div></li><li><span class=3D"n">4</=
span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>Inventory Service:</strong> the only wr=
iter of fare counts, seats and holds.</p></div></li><li><span class=3D"n">5=
</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>Payment Service:</strong> talks to th=
e payment gateway (authorize, capture, void, refund).</p></div></li><li><sp=
an class=3D"n">6</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>Ticketing Service:</s=
trong> issues 13-digit e-ticket numbers from pre-allocated number blocks.</=
p></div></li><li><span class=3D"n">7</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>W=
orkers:</strong> Search Indexer (cache refresh), Hold Sweeper (expiry), Re-=
accommodation (flight cancellations), plus a payment reconciler.</p></div><=
/li></ol><h3 id=3D"2-flow-search">2. Flow: Search</h3><figure class=3D"diag=
