<code>ACTIVE =E2=86=92 CONFIRMING</code> and <code>expires_at + 10 min</cod=
e>, only if still <code>ACTIVE</code> and not expired. Booking =E2=86=92 <c=
ode>PAYMENT_PENDING</code>.</p><div class=3D"subpt"><span class=3D"sn">3.1<=
/span><div>If the hold already expired =E2=86=92 410, nothing charged.</div=
></div><div class=3D"subpt"><span class=3D"sn">3.2</span><div>The sweeper n=
ever touches <code>CONFIRMING</code> holds, so the seats can't expire while=
